{"version":1,"breite":1080,"hoehe":1350,"texte":[{"text":"Verwaltungsrecht AT","box":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":373.2,"h":62.8},"innen":{"x":40,"y":16,"w":287.2,"h":30.8},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":28,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":30.8,"lsp":0.6,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":373.2,"h":62.8},"farbe":"rgb(51, 1, 34)","radius":0},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"4/7","box":{"x":974,"y":30,"w":68,"h":68},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":25,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":null,"lsp":1.6,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":974,"y":30,"w":68,"h":68},"farbe":"rgb(51, 1, 34)","radius":50},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"So prüfst du die Bekanntgabe","box":{"x":76,"y":236.2,"w":863.3,"h":92.4},"innen":{"x":110,"y":250.2,"w":795.3,"h":64.4},"schrift":"Space Grotesk","groesse":56,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":64.4,"lsp":-0.6,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":76,"y":236.2,"w":863.3,"h":92.4},"farbe":"rgb(51, 1, 34)","radius":44},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"Fiktion anwenden","box":{"x":204,"y":386.5,"w":770,"h":43.2},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":36,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(51, 1, 34)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":43.2,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":76,"y":362.5,"w":928,"h":214.6},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"Ein schriftlicher Verwaltungsakt, der im Inland durch die Post übermittelt wird, gilt am vierten Tag nach der Aufgabe zur Post als bekannt gegeben (§ 41 Abs. 2 S. 1 VwVfG).","box":{"x":204,"y":435.7,"w":770,"h":117.4},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":29,"gewicht":"400","farbe":"rgb(43, 43, 51)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":39.2,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":76,"y":362.5,"w":928,"h":214.6},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"Früherer Zugang ändert nichts","box":{"x":204,"y":621.2,"w":770,"h":43.2},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":36,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(51, 1, 34)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":43.2,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":76,"y":597.2,"w":928,"h":175.5},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"Kommt der Brief früher an, bleibt es beim vierten Tag. Die Frist wird dadurch nicht kürzer.","box":{"x":204,"y":670.3,"w":770,"h":78.3},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":29,"gewicht":"400","farbe":"rgb(43, 43, 51)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":39.2,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":76,"y":597.2,"w":928,"h":175.5},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"Ausnahme prüfen","box":{"x":204,"y":816.6,"w":770,"h":43.2},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":36,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(51, 1, 34)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":43.2,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":76,"y":792.6,"w":928,"h":253.8},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"Die Fiktion gilt nicht, wenn der Bescheid gar nicht oder später zugegangen ist; im Zweifel muss die Behörde Zugang und Zeitpunkt nachweisen (§ 41 Abs. 2 S. 3 VwVfG).","box":{"x":204,"y":865.8,"w":770,"h":156.6},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":29,"gewicht":"400","farbe":"rgb(43, 43, 51)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":39.2,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":76,"y":792.6,"w":928,"h":253.8},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"Landesrecht mitdenken","box":{"x":204,"y":1090.4,"w":770,"h":43.2},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":36,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(51, 1, 34)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":43.2,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":76,"y":1066.4,"w":928,"h":175.5},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(228, 29, 120)"},{"text":"Handelt eine Landesbehörde, gilt das Landes-VwVfG. Dessen aktuelle Fassung der Fiktion kurz gegenprüfen.","box":{"x":204,